  "claims": [
    {
      "text": "Against Bay Pavilion she is the first of Fang Yuan’s side to answer. She stretches her right arm, closes her five fingers, and jabs at a storey building water elephant. The ray destroys that water elephant instantly. Fang Yuan names the fire path killer move. It originated from Purple Mountain True Monarch, whose inheritances Fang Yuan holds.",
